  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal word. Common patterns include {庇護|ひご}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧ (receive protection), {庇護|ひご}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{求|もと}める→求める：02316_motomeru⟧ (seek asylum/protection), {庇護|ひご}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧もと⟦で→で：00502_de⟧ (under the protection of). In international law and news, {庇護|ひご} is the standard term for \"asylum\" as in political asylum.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {庇護|ひご}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧: receive protection\n- {庇護|ひご}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{求|もと}める→求める：02316_motomeru⟧: seek asylum/protection\n- {庇護|ひご}⟦{申請|しんせい}→申請：04207_shinsei⟧: asylum application\n- {庇護|ひご}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧もと⟦で→で：00502_de⟧: under the protection of",
